00:07:22.528 --> 00:07:26.560
<v Host>Time for a short quiz. Listen and try to answer.

00:07:27.160 --> 00:07:33.591
<v Slow>三つのふすま絵は、昔、どこにありましたか。

00:07:34.391 --> 00:07:37.463
