00:07:38.064 --> 00:07:46.127
<v Slow>青森県の古い家は、何年ぐらい、絵を守ってきましたか。

00:07:46.927 --> 00:07:49.399
<v Host>For more than one hundred years.

00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:56.504
<v Slow>三つの絵は、今、どこで見ることができますか。

00:07:57.303 --> 00:08:04.528
<v Host>At the Tokyo Metropolitan Art Museum in Ueno, Tokyo. The exhibition runs until October eighteenth.

00:08:05.127 --> 00:08:19.935
<v Host>That's all for today. Three paintings that were separated for one hundred fifty years are finally side by side again in Tokyo. If you are in Japan this autumn, you can go and see this once-in-a-lifetime reunion. See you tomorrow!

00:08:20.536 --> 00:08:22.935
<v News>また明日。
